dtrack): sentence_id 0: \"The Muppets: An Original Walt Disney Records Soundtrack is a soundtrack album released by Walt Disney Records on November 22, 2011 for the musical comedy film \\\"The Muppets\\\".\" Title: \"The Muppets (soundtrack)\". So citation: [\"The Muppets (soundtrack)\", 0].\n\nThus answer: \"The Rescuers\". Provide JSON.\n\n"},"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":1623,"completion_tokens":579,"total_tokens":2202,"audio_prompt_tokens":0},"created":1791994787,"object":"chat.completion","prompt_filter_results":null}